/ActualText (In October 2022, the Central Bureau of Investigation \(CBI\) uncovered a major CSAM racket operating out of Bhopal. The investigation led to the arrest of five individuals who were found distributing CSAM through various online platforms. This operation was part of a larger crackdown called "Operation Carbon," aimed at dismantling networks involved in the creation and dissemination of CSAM.)
