/S /H1
/T (->Surat Case \(2018\): In 2018, police in Surat arrested a 27-year-old man who was found in possession of over 100,000 images and videos of CSAM. The investigation revealed that the accused had been distributing this material through social media and file-sharing platforms. This case underscored the pervasive nature of CSAM distribution networks and the challenges faced by law enforcement in tracking and prosecuting offenders)
/E (->Surat Case \(2018\): In 2018, police in Surat arrested a 27-year-old man who was found in possession of over 100,000 images and videos of CSAM. The investigation revealed that the accused had been distributing this material through social media and file-sharing platforms. This case underscored the pervasive nature of CSAM distribution networks and the challenges faced by law enforcement in tracking and prosecuting offenders)
