542 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In end, the complete and thorough report on Child Sexual Material \(CSAM\) has showed about a harshand upsetting reality about the number and effect of online child abuse/mistreatment. The findings of this report highlight the extremely important need for clear action to combat and prevent CSAM in all its forms.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
543 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Through the analysis of data, case studies, and general ways things are going, this report has brought to light the terrible and destructive effects of CSAM on the lives of capable of being hurt children. It has highlighted the sneaky and harmful nature of online abuse/mistreatment, the \(existing all over a large area\) circulation of harmful material, and the long-term results on the mental and physical well-being of victims.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
544 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (More than that, the report has highlighted the extreme importance of working together effort among, including governments, police \(services businesses/government units\), technology companies, NGOs, and the public. Dealing with the many-sided challenges created byor presented by CSAM needs a united and coordinated effort to strengthen prevention, detection, and prosecution methods.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
545 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (As we face these hidden horrors head-on, the report draws attention to the need for strong and healthy law-based improved solutions, increased and education, and complete and thorough support services for victims and survivors. By putting into use a victim-centered approach and putting in order of importance the protection of children, we can try towards a safer and more secure online \(surrounding conditions\) for all.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
546 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Moving forward, it is extremely important that the findings and recommendations of this report inform policies, and attempts aimed at fighting CSAM. By standing together, raising our voices, and taking real and clear actions, we can create a world where children are safeguarded from abuse/mistreatment and where the hidden horrors of CSAM are no longer tolerated.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
